{{color|red|A structure of ultrarainbow is a kind of}} [[The Box|{{color|red|''Box''}}]] {{color|red|that is the most colorful structure to currently exist, consisting of only colors and no grayscale.}} {{color|orange|Even the text on this page is colorful as it for some reason also counts towards how colorful this verse is, much like the}} [[Orangeverse|{{color|orange|''Orangeverse''}}]]{{color|orange|, except the infobox text is still not saturated because it can't be controlled.}} {{color|yellow|The color of the text also seems to move onto the next color of the rainbow or loop in color every sentence on this page.}} {{color|green|The only things contained by structures of ultrarainbow are entities known as Rainbow Beings, which have no objective.}} {{color|blue|The reason this verse is so colorful is because it automatically filters out all grayscale inside and replaces it with another color in under a}} [[Yalmeon Time|{{color|blue|''Yalmeon Time''}}]] {{color|blue|due to the strange laws in this kind of verse.}}

== {{color|indigo|Symptoms}} ==

{{color|purple|There are 2 symptoms that you get upon entering a structure of ultrarainbow:}}

{{color|red|1: All grayscale in the entity's look will be replaced with a random color unable to be seen in grayscale, this symptom being called Fashion of Ultrarainbow.}}

{{color|orange|2: The entity's vision will also replace all grayscale with a disco of colors unable to be seen in grayscale, this symptom being called Vision of Ultrarainbow.}}


{{color|yellow|This page is also composed almost ENTIRELY of}} [[Template:Color|{{color|yellow|''Color Templates''}}]]{{color|yellow|.}} {{color|green|This verse is also more colorful than the}} [[Rainbowcosmos|{{color|green|''Rainbowcosmos''}}]] {{color|green|and}} [[Deltabox|{{color|green|''Deltabox''}}]]{{color|green|.}}
